66. FINAL ARCHITECTURAL PRINCIPLE

Local Path

> CNS owns the model execution environment.



Free Remote Path

> CNS consumes an approved remote inference resource according to its available quota and access conditions.



Paid API Path

> CNS consumes a provider's official API service.



Authorized Subscription Path

> CNS uses the provider's officially supported subscription entitlement through the provider's authorized interface.



Universal Model Bus

> CNS decides which model and which legitimate execution path should perform the work.




